1471, "Protect the cargo containers"

1472, "Protect the transports"

1473, "Stop the Pirate Iota 7"

1474, "Protect the escape pods"

1475, "This is the Talus Mining Facility.  Commencing evacuation procedures now.  Pods en route to jump node.  Requesting fighter escort."

1476, "Hostiles have opened fire on escape pods!  Request immediate assistance!"

1477, "Alpha 1, Pandarus' got a bogus heading."

1478, "Pandarus, confirm your destination."

1479, "This is the GTFr Pandarus.  Nav systems are off line.  Situation under control."

1480, "Alpha 1, scan the Pandarus.  We need IFF verification."

