2210, "Destroy Cargo Depot"

2211, "Destroy Any Freighters"

2212, "Cargo depot ahead, Sir.  Reading four Seth class fighters on patrol."

2213, "This is odd.  Sensors show shield systems on those Virgo Hammer of Light ships!"

2214, "A Shivan Cain class cruiser just jumped in!  It's the Taranis!"

2215, "Damn it!  The Shivans have destroyed the Ramses."

2216, "Alpha 1, you must destroy all remaining cargo containers."

2217, "We can't allow the Shivans access to more supplies."

2218, "Cargo depot successfully destroyed."

2219, "That freighter is going down."

2220, "Alpha 1, do NOT engage the Taranis."

