2222, "First Strike"

2223, "First part of the Shivan cruiser capture, part a."

2224, "$b * $b GTD $b Galatea
$b * $b Ikeya $b System
$b * $b 1/31/35

$b The $b Taranis

Initial attacks have gone off without a hitch, and the Taranis is on her last leg.  Delta and Epsilon wings have destroyed most of the Taranis's fighter escort.  It is time to finish the job.

To this end, Terran Command has sent a full wing of Athena bombers, equipped with the newly developed Stiletto bomb."

2225, "$b New $b Technology: $b Athena $b Bomber

The Athena is our most maneuverable bomber.  It carries a massive payload, yet, in dogfights, is nearly as effective as a fighter."

2226, "$b New $b Technology: $b Stiletto $b Space $b Bomb

The Stiletto bomb has now been thoroughly tested back in Sol and is now ready for use.  It can be used to destroy subsystems on any ship and should prove more effective than the Disruptor cannon.  The electronics seeking device should make it simple to use.  Just point and shoot.

Stiletto homing capabilities are limited, so make sure you get a clean shot before you launch.  The Stiletto should be especially useful in destroying the Taranis' engines and weapons systems.

All Athena bombers will be equipped with Stilettos and will be piloted by Alpha wing."

2227, "The Cain-class cruiser Taranis has been chased from the Beta Cygni system back to the Ikeya system.  It is low on supplies, and, due to recent engagements, it is lightly guarded."

2228, "The Cain-class cruiser $h Taranis has begun its counterattack.  Although we destroyed most of its fighter escort, it managed to call in a repair craft.  It is now nearly fully functional."

2229, "Long range sensors indicate that only two fighters and three bombers remain to protect the Taranis."

2230, "The Taranis is heading for the Beta Cygni subspace node, where it will probably resupply.  This will allow for a small window of opportunity in which to conduct a strike."

2231, "The Taranis is heading for the Beta Cygni subspace node, where we expect it to mount an offensive.  This only allows a small window of opportunity in which to conduct a preemptive strike."

2232, "Your primary objective is to disable and disarm the $h Taranis in order to enable its capture.  This will be our first attempt to capture a major Shivan vessel.  Three wings will be assigned to this task."

2233, "Alpha Wing will be flying Athena bombers.  These bombers just arrived on the Galatea and are equipped with the new Stiletto bomb.  The Stiletto is capable of destroying subsystems in one hit.  Alpha's primary responsibility will be to disarm and disable the Taranis."

2234, "Beta Wing is assigned to escort Alpha and protect it from fighter attacks.  Beta will fly Apollo-class fighters."

2235, "Gamma wing will fly Valkyries and should engage any hostile fighters and bombers in the area.  If needed elsewhere, they can be assigned to any task that you see fit."

2236, "Once the Taranis has been disarmed and disabled, $f Omega transports will arrive and capture it.  When the Taranis has been captured, you are to return to the Galatea for debriefing."

2237, "Do not allow the $h Taranis to escape or be destroyed.

Good luck."

2238, "The purpose of this mission was to capture a major Shivan vessel for analysis.  It was imperative to the war effort.  Your failure is unforgivable.

Perhaps one day you will learn that the consequences of your actions affect others.  Until that time, you are dismissed from all duties."

2239, "To disable the Taranis without destroying it, you must employ weapons that do very little hull damage.  Your best alternative would probably have been Stiletto bombs and Disruptor lasers.

If the Shivan wing Rama is destroying the cruiser, pursue and distract them.  Use your wingmen to help take them out."

2240, "The Taranis has escaped to the Beta Cygni system.

Not only has the chance to capture a Shivan cruiser been lost, but the Taranis is certain to wreak havoc in other systems.

You were ordered to disable the Taranis.  Inability to follow simple orders makes it clear that you do not belong on the Galatea.  You are hereby dismissed from all duties."

2241, "Destroying the Taranis' engine subsystem is your first, and most important task.

If the Shivan fighters are stopping you, have Beta and Gamma wing cover you while you make runs at the Taranis.

If you absolutely can't make it through, tell your wingmen to disable the Taranis.  A few well placed Stilettos should make short work of the engines."

2242, "You departed before ensuring the capture of the Taranis.  The Omega transports you left unprotected were destroyed by Shivan fighters.

Our hopes of capturing the Taranis were ruined by your carelessness.

Your career is over, Pilot."

2243, "Disarming the Taranis might seem difficult, but if you are careful about it, it shouldn't be too difficult.

Once disabled, the Taranis will be unable to move, making disarming it much easier.

Take out its Missile Launchers first, then the weapons subsystem.  This will hamper the accuracy of its remaining turrets, and give you ample time to take them out."

2244, "You departed before ensuring the capture of the Taranis.  The Omega transports you left unprotected were destroyed by Shivan fighters.

Our hopes of capturing the Taranis were ruined by your carelessness.

Your career is over, pilot."

2245, "After you have disabled and disarmed the Taranis, you must wait until it's been successfully captured.

This may take awhile, but it is your duty to oversee the process, and to protect the ships involved.

If this gets too difficult, you may call in Delta wing to assist you."

2246, "Congratulations, Alpha 1.  You were instrumental in the first capture of a major Shivan vessel!

The Halkins is taking her to the Tombaugh station, where engineers will be able to study their technology and learn more about their methods and motives.

Meanwhile, feel free to relax for a few days.  You deserve it.

In recognition of your continuing service to the GTA, you have been awarded the Medal of Good Conduct."

2247, "Disable The Taranis"

2248, "Disarm The Taranis"

2249, "Oversee Capture of Taranis"

