2252, "What are we waiting for?"

2253, "Sir, the Taranis is disarmed."

2254, "Sir, the Taranis is disabled."

2255, "Omega here.  On approach to Taranis."

2256, "Attempting to attach to the Taranis."

2257, "Attachment unsuccessful.  Omega 2, give it a shot."

2258, "Penetrating the hull will take some time.  Stand by."

2259, "It's not working, the hull is too strong.  We'll need to tow it to Tombaugh Station."

2260, "Freighter Halkins here.  Command said you needed some help."

2261, "Halkins, we need you to attach to that cruiser and tow it back to Tombaugh."

2262, "Roger.  Moving into position now."

2263, "We've docked.  Give us time to brace the attachment."

2264, "Attachment secure.  We're heading to the subspace node."

2265, "Jumping out now.  See you at Tombaugh."

2266, "Damn!  The Taranis has been destroyed.  Return to the Galatea immediately!"

