2319, "Guard GTT Stull"

2320, "Engines critical!  Evacuate the area!"

2321, "The area is secure, report back to base."

2322, "We need to evacuate the Asimov.  Transports will be arriving soon.  Keep the area secure."

2323, "Scientiests are safe.  Clear out the rest of the hostiles and return to the Galatea."

2324, "Hull at 50%.  Don't know how much more we can take."

2325, "We need to evacuate.  The station is becoming very unstable."

2326, "The Scientists are dead.  Return to base."

2327, "Get us out of here!  It's gonna blow."

