$b * $b 2/15/35

$b Our $b Mission

The Hammer of Light has decimated the Vasudan fleet at Vega.  Most of the surviving Vasudan forces have retreated to Deneb and Antares.  Because our fleet is also holding Antares, relations between the VPE and the GTA have been strained.

In order to quell the tension, we have been ordered to eliminate all Hammer of Light outposts in the vicinity.  Fortunately, we have some new tools to assist us."

2331, "$b New $b Technology: $b Phoenix $b V $b Missile

Our first new weapon is the Phoenix V anti-bomber warhead.  This missile can puncture even the thickest of shields, and can also be used effectively against larger targets, like freighters.  More details are available in the Tech Room."

2332, "$b New $b Technology: $b Medusa $b Bomber

We have also acquired a wing of the new Medusa bombers.  Though they are slower and less maneuverable than the Athena, they are far more powerful.  Once again, full details can be found in the Tech Room."

2333, "$b New $b Technology: $b Tsunami $b Space $b Bomb

The new Tsunami bomb is the ultimate anti-cruiser weapon, and can be carried by the Medusas.  Just a few of these will take out any cruiser, and the Hammer of Light Aten-class cruisers are no exception.  You'll be using this bomb quite often against major Hammer of Light outposts."

2334, "Here in the Antares system we have detected a small HOL base of operations.  Your squadron is being sent to eliminate it."

2335, "You will destroy all Hammer of Light ships, then jump back to the Galatea.  The Galatea will be monitoring you in case the situation gets out of control.  Good luck."

2336, "We are pleased that you were able to suppress the Shivan influence in the Beta Aquilae system.  Their arrival was unexpected, and battling the Shivans always takes a heavy toll on our forces.  Fortunately, we can take some bitter comfort in the fact that they ''helped'' us eliminate the Hammer of Light presence in Beta Aquilae.

In light of your recent achievements in protecting GTA space from the Shivan threat, we are awarding you with the Distinguished Service Cross.  You are truly an outstanding pilot."

2337, "Upon evaluating this mission, we have concluded that the Hammer of Light was gathered in the Beta Aquilae system only to lure the Shivans to the area.  Now that a Shivan presence in Beta Aquilae has been established, God help the Alliance."

2338, "You should be able to hold out until the Galatea arrives without much difficulty.  Try to conserve strength in these first few battles, and then once the Hellions warp in, use everything you have against them.  The Galatea can handle all the fighters and even one cruiser, but you have to help it out in damaging them.  The more turrets you destroy on a cruiser, the less damage the Galatea will receive."

2339, "It saddens us that this mission cost the Alliance so many of her fine pilots.  It is our duty to honor their memories.  Tragedies such as this must strengthen our resolve against our enemies."

2340, "Destroy the Hellions"

2341, "Eliminate All Hammer of Light presence in Beta Aquilae"

2342, "Destroy All Shivans in Area"

2343, "Ensure Galatea's Hull >50"

2344, "What the hell happened to the Hammer outpost?"

2345, "I'm reading nothing but Shivans!"

2346, "Galatea, we are in an intense situation with Shivan forces!  Request assistance!"

2347, "We are already engaged.  Standby."

2348, "Glad to see the cavalry could make it."

2349, "Galatea ready to assist."

2350, "Sending Delta wing now."

2351, "We can't hold out much longer!"

2352, "We need assistance!  Galatea is taking heavy damage!"

2353, "Gamma wing jumping out."

2354, "Beta wing is outta here."

2355, "Let's head back to base, Alpha wing."

2356, "Battle area is clear.  Entering subspace now."

2357, "Where Eagles Dare"

2358, "In this mission we will be assaulting a secondary supply and rearming facility under Hammer of Light control.  It is located in an asteroid belt in the Antares system."

2359, "Intelligence indicates the main defenses will be two sentry guns and one wing of Vasudan fighters."

2360, "Recently, the transfer of cargo into this area has increased dramatically.  It appears to be coming from the Ribos system."

2361, "This jump node to the Ribos system is approximately ten kilometers away.  It will be the only means of escape.  All of the Gemini transports and freighters must be destroyed before they reach the subspace node."

2362, "A wing of GTA Freighters will come in to recover remaining cargo.  Keep the area secure until they are finished.  Good luck."

2363, "While you managed to secure the jump node, it is unfortunate that some of the Hammer of Light transports escaped.  We can only hope the supplies they carried won't harm us in the future."

2364, "Kill the fighters as fast as possible, and then order your wingmen to attack the freighters.  Concentrate on one freighter at a time, taking out their turrets first.  It shouldn't be too hard to stop them."

2365, "Excellent work.  The area has been secured and no Hammer of Light ships escaped.  Your persistence in accomplishing your objectives is to be commended."

2366, "Because we were unable to secure the jump node, our forces will not be able to reach Vasuda Prime.  The Hammer of Light's Typhon-class destroyer, Anvil, has positioned itself at the jump point, blocking our escape.  It seems only a matter of time before we are destroyed by the Shivans."

2367, "Taking out the freighters might be difficult, but it is definitely possible.  Try strafing runs to take our their turrets first.  If you disable their engines, they'll be a lot easier to kill.  Loading your ship with strong weapons might also help greatly."

2368, "Munitions"

2369, "Clear the area of all Hostile ships."

2370, "Destroy Gemini Transports"

2371, "Patrol until the freighters have finished."

2372, "Sir, the Vasudans are moving."

2373, "They are heading for the subspace node."

2374, "Keep the area secure until our freighters have arrived."

2375, "Taurus has escaped with the cargo.  Return to base."

2376, "Tenderizer"

2377, "In this mission, the player is ordered to patrol and clear the area near the Antares-Beta Aquilae jump node.  The Galatea will jump in from Ribos and jump to Beta Aquilae."

2378, "$b * $b GTD $b Galatea
$b * $b Antares $b System
$b * $b 2/19/35

$b The $b Tombaugh $b Attack

Terran Intelligence has spent the last two weeks analyzing flight data from the Tombaugh station attack.  The data on the Shivan Lucifer has been given special attention.  Intelligence believes the Shivans were tracking the captured Taranis Cruiser through subspace to the station."

2379, "$b The $b Lucifer

Intelligence doesn't know how the Shivans tracked the Taranis escort, but they've got a team of engineers trying to figure it out.  They are also analyzing the shield system on the Lucifer.  Unlike the shields on the Shivan fighters and bombers, this shield appears impervious, not merely resistant, to all of our weapons."

2380, "$b The $b Shivans' $b Attack $b Plan

With the loss of Tombaugh Station, the Shivans have gained control of the Ribos subspace node.  That leaves only two subspace jumps between the Lucifer fleet and the Vasudan homeworld.

We must defend Vasuda Prime.  Not only is it the humane thing to do, but it's in our own interests.  If the Shivans gain control of that system, it will be a short walk to Earth, itself."

2381, "$b The $b Location $b of $b Sol

While their proximity to Earth is cause for concern, we have no reason to believe that the Shivans know the location of our homeworld.  There are dozens of star systems off the Ribos node and the Shivans will likely have to examine them all.  It is obvious, however, that they are narrowing it down, and we can't afford to give up one more inch."

2382, "$b Our $b Orders

The Lucifer-class Destroyer was last sighted in the Ribos system, leading us to believe that Antares is the focal point for the next Shivan offensive.  We're going to move the Galatea and its fleet to the Beta Aquilae system, in case the Shivans decide to attack Vasuda Prime through there.

Command is sending another Orion-class destroyer, the GTD Bastion, to the Antares system to help us with the blockade.  But for the time being we're the only defense."

2383, "$b New $b Technologies: $b Hercules $b Fighter $b and $b Synaptic $b Cluster $b Bomb.

I am pleased to announce we have two new weapons to use against the Shivans, the Hercules Heavy Assault Fighter, and the Synaptic cluster bomb.  You may study these in the Tech Room.  They will prove very useful."

2384, "Report in twenty minutes for your mission briefings."

2385, "In order to protect Vasuda Prime, the $f GTD $f Galatea will be moving from Antares to Beta Aquilae.

Alpha and Beta wings will provide escort."

2386, "The sentry guns surrounding the jump node were severely damaged in the recent Hammer of Light attack.  Alpha wing will inspect the sentry guns, to determine if they are salvageable.  Beta wing will provide cover."

2387, "The Galatea will jump into Antares, reset its coordinates, then jump to Beta Aquilae.  Lately, the Hammer of Light has been attacking all ships passing through the jump node.  It is your responsibility to destroy all enemy ships that you encounter."

2388, "After the Galatea jumps to Beta Aquilae, you will be contacted by the Detiula Installation in the Antares system.  There you will receive your briefing and move on to your next mission.  Intelligence has specifically requested you and your wing for these missions.  Good luck, Pilot."

2389, "Don't jump out."

2390, "The destruction of the Galatea is a major loss for the Terran Alliance.  Thousands of lives were lost due to your poor execution.  Perhaps this task should have been given to a more skilled pilot.

You are hereby stripped of all rank and duties in the GTA."

2391, "Protect the Galatea!  Destroy the Kamikaze fighters before they can reach the Galatea.  Once the Mauler arrives, order all your wingmen to attack it.  Perhaps disabling its engines might help you prevent it from hitting the Galatea"

2392, "This section removed"

2393, "Explosives"

2394, "Guard the Galatea"

2395, "Destroy Libra"

2396, "Inspect the Sentry Guns"

2397, "Destroy Mauler"

2398, "Protect the Galatea until it Jumps"

2399, "Not much happening here, Alpha wing."

2400, "All clear here, Beta."

2401, "TC seems to have placed our flight path near a patch of asteroids.  Gotta love the Alliance, right?"

2402, "Ha!  Yeah, those brainiacs at Command are really something."

2403, "It's a trap!  We've been set up!"

2404, "So much for a quiet patrol!"

2405, "Alpha to Galatea, area is clear.  You are clear to jump in."

2406, "Galatea jumping in.  Proceeding to Beta Aquilae."

2407, "Hammer attack squad jumping in!  Protect the Galatea!"

2408, "Delta wing coming in to assist."

2409, "Galatea jumping to Beta Aquilae."

2410, "Galatea heavily damaged, pilots!  We need your protection!"

2411, "Pilots, stand by for further orders."

2412, "On our way."

2413, "Let's wrap it up."

2414, "Our hull is seriously weakened!  We cannot continue this battle!  Request immediate assistance!"

2415, "Someone reprogrammed the sentries!"

2416, "Alpha 1, stand by.  Your new orders are coming through now."

2417, "Taurus and Cancer are trying to ram the Galatea!"

2418, "Pilots, destroy those kamikaze fighters!  They're loaded with warheads."

2419, "The Mauler is on a direct impact course for the Galatea!"

2420, "Shell Game"

2421, "In which the player tries to glean some information about the Shivan SuperDestroyer, destroy some Shivan ships, and steal some Shivan cargo."

2422, "We have reason to believe that the Shivan Destroyer Eva is in the Antares system near the Antares-Vega Jump Node.

You will jump to this subspace node and investigate.  Destroy all hostiles.

Further orders will be given to you in-mission.

Delta wing will be flying Medusa bombers and will assist you.  If you need further assistance, you may call in Epsilon wing.  Galactic Terran Intelligence out."

2423, "This isn't a bug because this stage doesn't ever get shown in a Red Alert briefing.  Please don't report it as one."

2424, "This section was also removed."

2425, "We are disappointed that you saw fit to ignore a direct order and destroy the Shivan cargo.  We had hoped to examine the cargo to learn more about the Shivan technology."

2426, "Don't shoot at the Shivan cargo."

2427, "We have recovered two of the abandoned cargo containers.  Intelligence believes analysis will prove useful so that the Stern and Dobbs won't have been lost in vain.

You are awarded the Good Conduct medal for your continuing service to the Alliance."

2428, "It saddens us that so many pilots lost their lives in this mission.  Fortunately the recovery of the Shivan cargo containers means their loss was not in vain."

2429, "Figuring out why the Shivan fighters arrive might help you greatly in predicting their attacks.  Try doing things differently."

2430, "It took great skill to destroy the freighters while preserving the cargo.  Well done, pilot."

2431, "That you were also able to destroy all Shivan transports is impressive."

2432, "Leaving the area before completing mission objectives is gross negligence.  Because of your cowardice, innocent lives will be lost.  Such conduct can not be tolerated."

2433, "Don't jump out of the mission until the mission is finished!"

2434, "Indeterminate"

2435, "Destroy Transports"

2436, "Identify Cargo 4"

2437, "Destroy the Shivan freighters."

2438, "Destroy the Shivan Transports"

2439, "Protect the Shivan Cargo"

2440, "Refusing order to dock with Shivan Cargo!"

2441, "GTT Stern.  You are under direct orders to dock with the Shivan cargo."

2442, "With all due respect, I will not place my crew at risk."

2443, "Very well.  Alpha 1, scan the Shivan cargo container."

2444, "Roger.  Waiting for Alpha to scan the cargo."

2445, "I'm getting normal readings on the container."

2446, "GTT Stern moving in to dock."

2447, "The Stern has been destroyed."

2448, "Pilots!  Don't destroy the cargo!"

2449, "We'll send in a team of transports to tow the cargo back to base."

2450, "The Shivans are leaving their cargo behind!"

2451, "You were clearly ordered to NOT destroy the cargo!  Pilots, secure the area and jump back to base."

2452, "We've got four Shivan freighters with cargo and two transports in the area."

2453, "The Eva jumped out before we could reach it."

2454, "Alpha and Beta, try to destroy the freighters without destroying the cargo."

2455, "GTT Harmon moving in to dock with Shivan cargo."

2456, "GTT Marcos docking with Shivan cargo now."

2457, "Transport Dobbs on docking approach now."

2458, "I'm picking up some strange readings from this cargo... it looks like some*--"

2459, "Enter the Dragon"

2460, "An attack on a Shivan repair station masks a far more daring plan."

2461, "$b * $b GTD $b Galatea
$b * $b Deneb $b System
$b * $b 2/20/35

$b Our $b Orders

We are under general quarters because a fighter patrol detected advance ships from the Lucifer fleet approaching Vasuda Prime.

Somehow, the Shivan forces have circumvented our blockade at Antares, and now control the Deneb system.  We are en route to Deneb as we speak.  ETA is thirty-five minutes, so when you leave here, report to your wing station for immediate mission briefings.

The Lucifer itself is behind the vanguard force, so we can expect it to make an appearance at any time."

2462, "$b New $b Technology: $b Ulysses $b Advanced $b Fighter

The Vasudan-Terran Ulysses project has been completed, and the Galatea has received a complement of these fighters.  It is the most maneuverable craft ever developed by the PVN or the GTA, and it should be extremely useful in this next series of sorties.  It can also be equipped with the Prometheus cannon, the most powerful cannon weapon we've ever developed.  Use them both well."

2463, "$b Capturing $b a $b Shivan $b Fighter

Intelligence has concocted a daring plan to enable us to learn more about the Shivans.  We are going to attempt to capture a Shivan fighter.  Suit up and report to your wing stations for briefings immediately."

2464, "The Shivans have established quite a base of operations in the Deneb system.  They have multiple supply depots scattered across the system, as well as several repair centers for their damaged fighters."

2465, "Each of their repair stations consists of a Cain-class cruiser and extra supplies.  The Shakti is one such cruiser in the area."

2466, "All fighters in the area around the Shakti are damaged and in need of repair.  This makes them easy targets.  One of our objectives in this mission is to put this repair station out of commission.  This will greatly reduce Shivan capability in the Deneb system."

2467, "All the fighters in the area near the Shakti are damaged and in need of repair.  This makes them easy targets."

2468, "One of the fighters being repaired by the Shakti is a Dragon-class fighter, designated '$h Arjuna $h 1'.  The Dragon is the Shivans' most maneuverable craft, and the most dangerous."

2469, "Intelligence has requested that we capture the Dragon for research purposes.  Since the Arjuna 1 Dragon is very low on power, it is in a weakened state, and is the best candidate for this operation.  You must disable Arjuna 1 by destroying its engine subsystem."

2470, "Once Arjuna 1 has been disabled, the $f Charon will dock with it and jump back to the Galatea.  We must capture Arjuna 1.  We cannot allow it to be destroyed.  To this end, we've equipped your craft with an advanced disruptor cannon.  Use it to take out its engines."

2471, "Since this station is so poorly defended, we are sending only Alpha and Beta to attack.  Alpha will cover Beta until the Shakti has been destroyed.  Then Alpha will attempt to disable Arjuna 1."

2472, "If Alpha fails to disable Arjuna 1, Delta wing will be available.  As Delta is currently guarding the $f Bastion, we will only send them in if it is imperative.  However, we believe you can do it without their help."

2473, "Because we are custom outfitting your ship, you will not be able to customize your loadout.  You have your orders.  Dismissed."

2474, "Great work Alpha 1.  We've destroyed a Shivan repair depot, and managed to get ahold of an intact Shivan fighter.  Our technicians are currently working on reverse engineering it."

2475, "For your excellent piloting abilities, the GTA has decided to award you the Distinguished Flying Cross.  Congratulations."

2476, "Your failure to destroy the Shakti has crippled our chances of holding the Deneb sector.  Such critical failures cannot be tolerated."

2477, "Your best bet in destroying the Shakti is your Beta wing bombers.  If you can keep the fighters off their backs for long enough for them to get off their Tsunami bombs, the Shakti is doomed.  However, even if you lose the bombers, you can still destroy the Shakti yourself.  Try taking out its weapons systems first, and then its turrets.  If worse comes to worst, you can call in Delta to assist you."

2478, "Good work destroying the Shakti.  Delta wing was successful in capturing the Dragon-class fighter.  However, due to Delta's absence, the Bastion took quite a beating near Deneb III.  She survived, but is in need of repairs.  It is unfortunate that you needed their help to disable a single Shivan fighter."

2479, "Disabling a Dragon is no easy task, but you have been equipped with the proper tools to do it.  Arjuna 1's power supply is low, and it cannot regenerate its shields.  Concentrate first on eliminating its shielding, and then focus on trying to get off any hits you can with the Advanced Disruptor.  Patience is the key."

2480, "You were specifically ordered not to destroy Arjuna 1.  Yet it was destroyed.  Such insubordination cannot be tolerated.  While we regret having to do so, we are grounding you for the next three months."

2481, "Do not destroy Arjuna 1.  While using the Prometheus to weaken its shields is useful, make sure you are only using the Advanced Disruptor once the Dragon's shields are down.  Do not use your missiles on it either."

