2554, "Evangelist"

2555, "The Player destroys the Eva."

2556, "The Eva has entered the Deneb system.  She is fully armed and is poised to attack the Deneb-Vasuda Prime jump node."

2557, "She is protected by Arjuna and Krishna wings."

2558, "Alpha wing will lead an attack squadron to destroy the Eva.  Alpha will fly bombers.  Gamma and Beta will cover them."

2559, "We suggest you damage the weapons subsystem on the Eva before you launch your Tsunami bombs.  This will prevent the Eva from shooting them down."

2560, "You may need to call in a support ship to rearm yourself.  It is estimated that at least 20 Tsunami bombs will be needed to take the Eva down."

2561, "Destroying the Eva is imperative.  With the Lucifer in the system as well, we cannot tolerate the presence of another Shivan capital ship.  Good luck."

2562, "If you were playing this through a campaign, you would never see this.  It would take you straight into the next mission."

2563, "You failed to destroy the Eva.  We cannot hope to defend this system against two Shivan capital ships.  We will now be retreating to Vasuda Prime, where we must make a stand."

2564, "First, get rid of the Dragons by ordering your wingmen.  Your first task should be taking out the weapons system on the Eva.  Keep the fighters away from you long enough to do this, then fire your Tsunamis at your leisure.  You may need to rearm yourself a few times to increase your payload."

