2734, "Destroy Reactor 2"

2735, "Destroy Reactor 3"

2736, "Destroy Reactor 4"

2737, "Destroy Reactor 5"

2738, "Destroy the Lucifer"

2739, "All right, everyone, we don't have much time.  You've got to take out those reactors ASAP."

2740, "Alpha 1, you've got to make sure those Ursas can deliver their payload.  Protect them at all costs!"

2741, "As for Delta wing, it's going to be up to you to take out those reactors.  Get it done!"

2742, "You've only got seven minutes left!  Hurry!"

2743, "Three minutes left.  Please, you must hurry!"

2744, "Alpha 1, you have one minute left!"

