2776, "Alpha 1, Kappa 7's got a bogus heading."

2777, "This is the GTFr Kappa 7.  Nav systems are off line.  Situation under control."

2778, "Alpha 1, scan the Kappa 7.  We need IFF verification."

2779, "Escort Iota through an asteroid field to a secret GTI safe spot.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2780, "Protect the GTD Krios from an opposing Shivan force.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2781, "Inspect the remains of the Ross 128 attack.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

